[00:21.12]1. We thank you, Jehovah, each day and each night,
[00:32.83]That you shed upon us your precious light.
[00:43.83]We thank you that we have the priv’lege of prayer,
[00:54.63]That we can approach you with ev’ry care.
[01:15.36]2. We thank you, Jehovah, for your loving Son,
[01:25.60]Who conquered the world; by his faith he won.
[01:35.23]We thank you for guidance in doing your will.
[01:47.23]You lovingly help us our vows fulfill.
[02:16.32]3. We thank you, our God, for the honor to preach
[02:30.04]About your great name and the truth to teach.
[02:42.91]We thank you that soon all earth’s woes will be past,
[03:12.39]While your Kingdom blessings forever last.